{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30754","headline":"校猎曲 · 马戴","name":"校猎曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚子畋郊野，布罟笼天涯。\n浮云张作罗，万草结成罝。\n意在绝飞鸟，臂弓腰镆鎁。\n远将射句践，次欲诛夫差。\n壮志一朝尽，他□□繁华。\n当时能猎贤，保国兼保家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30754.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30754","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}